WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:02.360
- How have you been
keeping yourselves busy?

00:00:02.360 --> 00:00:04.470
'Cause I know a lot of people have,

00:00:04.470 --> 00:00:07.100
while being stuck at home
have started new things.

00:00:07.100 --> 00:00:09.040
I have toddlers so I have started,

00:00:09.040 --> 00:00:10.960
I never thought I'd be one
of those adults coloring

00:00:10.960 --> 00:00:12.900
in those adult coloring books,

00:00:12.900 --> 00:00:14.150
well little did I know,

00:00:14.150 --> 00:00:15.760
the pandemic would bring that to light

00:00:15.760 --> 00:00:18.809
because I'm done drawing Jasmine.

00:00:18.809 --> 00:00:20.950
I can't color another Jasmine,

00:00:20.950 --> 00:00:22.280
so I've started coloring.
(laughing)

00:00:22.280 --> 00:00:24.330
Have y'all started doing anything?

00:00:24.330 --> 00:00:25.390
- Maisie?

00:00:25.390 --> 00:00:27.300
- Joey, you've been killing it.

00:00:27.300 --> 00:00:29.400
I've been watching her, so jealous, go on.

00:00:30.388 --> 00:00:34.260
- I started doing dioramas.

00:00:34.260 --> 00:00:36.040
I've taken-
- What?

00:00:36.040 --> 00:00:39.225
- It's like, so you know
like little house models.

00:00:39.225 --> 00:00:41.700
Like little models of mini scapes.

00:00:41.700 --> 00:00:43.570
So I make a mini library,

00:00:43.570 --> 00:00:46.130
last month that took
me three weeks to make

00:00:46.130 --> 00:00:48.200
and that was so
- Can I see it?

00:00:48.200 --> 00:00:49.410
- much fun.

00:00:49.410 --> 00:00:50.950
Yeah, I have a photo of it.

00:00:50.950 --> 00:00:51.950
- Okay.

00:00:51.950 --> 00:00:55.860
- It's was so fun and
I just loved it so much

00:00:55.860 --> 00:00:58.000
and I just bought a little kit to make

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:00.750
a diorama coffee shop, so that, you know.

00:01:00.750 --> 00:01:02.240
This is my library.

00:01:03.587 --> 00:01:05.537
- Oh my gosh.
- What!

00:01:05.537 --> 00:01:06.970
- How!
- Oh my gosh!

00:01:06.970 --> 00:01:08.440
Well okay, I haven't done that

00:01:08.440 --> 00:01:10.620
but my kids have just
recently gotten into Legos.

00:01:10.620 --> 00:01:12.930
They're four and six so I've
started building little things

00:01:12.930 --> 00:01:16.410
like that, but that is crazy hard!

00:01:16.410 --> 00:01:18.970
- Oh my gosh, it was so hard.

00:01:18.970 --> 00:01:21.770
It took me, and the instructions,

00:01:21.770 --> 00:01:23.930
they're great but
they're kind of more like

00:01:23.930 --> 00:01:26.966
a loose suggestion of how to make it.

00:01:26.966 --> 00:01:27.799
(laughing)

00:01:27.799 --> 00:01:28.632
I'm like, I don't know what I'm doing

00:01:28.632 --> 00:01:29.480
but it was so fun.

00:01:29.480 --> 00:01:30.700
Maisie, what about you?

00:01:30.700 --> 00:01:33.320
- Well, it's kinds of funny
'cause since I was about

00:01:33.320 --> 00:01:36.690
four till 15, I had this
dream of having a farm

00:01:36.690 --> 00:01:38.600
and being a farmer and it
was just like this obsession,

00:01:38.600 --> 00:01:41.180
this dream of like, I'm just
gonna grow my own produce,

00:01:41.180 --> 00:01:42.430
raise my own animals.

00:01:42.430 --> 00:01:44.130
So I was like, right, I've got some time,

00:01:44.130 --> 00:01:45.360
I'm gonna start some gardening.

00:01:45.360 --> 00:01:46.320
I'm gonna do this.

00:01:46.320 --> 00:01:49.080
So I planted spinach, I planted okra,

00:01:49.080 --> 00:01:50.610
I did zucchini,
- Wow!

00:01:50.610 --> 00:01:52.810
- vegetables, everything,
and nothing grew.

00:01:52.810 --> 00:01:54.100
- Oh no!
- Oh,

00:01:54.100 --> 00:01:55.086
I was just about to say,

00:01:55.086 --> 00:01:56.427
I love okra.
(laughing)

00:01:56.427 --> 00:01:58.430
- The only thing that
grew was my sunflower

00:01:58.430 --> 00:02:00.410
'cause apparently it's
a weed, I didn't know.

00:02:00.410 --> 00:02:02.300
- And that's my favorite flower.

00:02:02.300 --> 00:02:04.390
- Exactly, so I had
this one little flower.

00:02:04.390 --> 00:02:05.535
I named it Kelly-

00:02:05.535 --> 00:02:09.179
- Oh my gosh, that's amazing!

00:02:09.179 --> 00:02:10.137
- I will persevere.

